  "description": "Turn an Umbraco site into an installable, offline-capable app, and see who installed it from the backoffice. Install prompt for Android and iOS, a network-first service worker, and install tracking that stays in your own database rather than a third-party dashboard.",
  "iconFile": "icon.png",
