  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "A fix release. The service worker no longer caches the backoffice when it is opened as /umbraco without a trailing slash, which had put backoffice HTML into the offline shell cache. The backoffice manifest now declares the NuGet package id, so Umbraco install telemetry is counted against the Marketplace listing rather than the App_Plugins folder name. No API, configuration or schema changes. Full changelog: https://github.com/BaryoDev/umbraco-pwa/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md",
